</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>根据《绍兴市教育局办公室关于开展</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019 </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年全市中小学书香少年和优秀阅读指导课评选活动的通知》，我校决定开展</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019 </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年绍兴一中书香少年和优秀阅读指导课评选活动。现将活动有关事项通知如下：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>一、评选对象</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>“书香少年”对象为全校学生；“阅读指导课”对象为承担我校阅读指导教学工作的学科教师、图书馆管理人员</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>二、评选要求</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>（一）书香少年</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．爱惜图书、热爱阅读，自觉利用课外时间广泛开展阅读，</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3> </FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>养成自主读书、做读书笔记等良好习惯；</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．阅读量大且内容丰富，每学期阅读课外书籍不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US> 10 </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>本，</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3> </FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>拥有自己的家庭小书架，有相对丰富的藏书量；</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．为学校优秀的阅读推广人，乐于向同学推荐好书并交流分享读书感受，阅读过程中善于思考和积累，每学期在校内外报刊杂志、校园网等发表读后感等不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US> 2 </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>篇；</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．积极参加学校或上级部门组织开展的各类阅读、征文等活动，在学校和区域内有一定的影响力。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>被推荐人需提供能充分体现“书香少年”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red">2~3 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>分钟的视频，视频要求：图像稳定，色彩正常；声音清晰，声画同步；要有片头片尾，显示标题、学校（学生）等信息。视频格式：采用高清</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red">MP4 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>格式，分辨率为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 1920*1080</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，比特率不小于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 4M</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>；或采用标清</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> MPG </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>格式，分辨率为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 720*576</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，比特率不小于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 6M</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（二）阅读指导课</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>课程要打破学科界限，整合学科知识，充分利用学校图书馆、校园智慧图书馆的纸质、电子图书资源，利用“书香校园”线上阅读平台开展系列读书活动、科普资料引导学生进行自主学习。内容不能为教材或课本内容。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．教学要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑴教学目标：符合阅读指导课教学要求，把握层次适度，培养学生收集、处理信息的能力，提高学生的阅读综合素养，激发学生课外阅读的兴趣并掌握一定的阅读方法。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>⑵教学内容：教学内容体现科学性、知识性和趣味性有机结合，</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>举例典型恰当，具有启发和教育意义，符合学生认知、思维、心理发展的特点。可以是读物推荐课、读书方法指导课、读书心得交流评论课、名著导读课、名著人物导读课、儿童绘本导读课、诗词阅读指导课及以时代、民俗民风、校园智慧图书馆的应用、“书香校园”线上读书活动等为主要教学内容。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>⑶教学过程：教学过程安排层次分明，符合认知规律；教学引导积极，指导正确，活泼互动，有效激发学生阅读动机；教学重点，难点处理恰当，在教学实施过程中，培养学生良好阅读习惯；</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>教学衔接合理，在有限的空间、时间和资源状态下，整体教学效益好。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑷教学方法：所选教学方法既注重实效又灵活多样，如采取品读法、摘读法（跳读法）、选读法，顺读法、尾读法等，努力贯彻以学生为主体的教学原则和方法；恰当采用现代化教学手段或其它形式进行教学；重视对学生思维方法和阅读方法的指导。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑸教学能力：能娴熟地驾驭所选教学材料与课堂，在教学中根椐实际情况恰当地及时调整教学活动；教态自然大方，语言准确生动、流畅；积极与学生展开知识交流，情感沟通。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑹教学环境：图书馆、阅览室、电子阅览室、校园智慧图书馆等环境布置有利于学生潜心阅读，不断提高阅读能力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑺教学效果：充分调动学生的积极性，学生思维活跃，知识，能力和思想等方面得到和谐发展，不同层次学生均可达到预期教学目标。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．视频要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>参评作品为一节课外阅读指导课的课堂实录（不超过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red">45 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>分钟），过程要完整，画面清晰。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑴要有片头，片头时长不超过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 5 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>秒。内容包括：课程名称、年级、主讲教师姓名和工作单位等；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑵视频格式以</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> MP4 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>文件为主，数据量不大于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 500MB</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，其他主流视频格式均可（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red">mov,flv,avi,flv,wmv</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑶原片分辨率在</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 720*576 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>或以上，视频数据小于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 500MB</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>；码流</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 0.5-1Mbps</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，视频总长度不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 30 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>分钟。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>⑷录像课录制建议不少于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"> 2 </SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>机位录制（自动录播教室应采用人工切换），要确保师生图像清晰、稳定。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: red"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>三、其他事项</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>参评学生和教师请将申报表和视频上传至公共文件夹“德育处</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>-2019</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年书香少年和优秀阅读指导课”，纸质版申报材料请交给德育处盛婷婷老师。申报表和视频截止时间为：</SPAN><FONT color=#ff0000><SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT></FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3><FONT color=#ff0000>日</FONT>。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3></FONT></SPAN> </P>
